sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant App as Excel/Word
    participant UIA as UI Automation
    participant UES as UiaEventService
    participant Reader as ProgramReader
    participant UEL as UiaElementService
    participant TTS as TextToSpeech

    User->>App: Navigate to cell B5
    App->>UIA: Fire FocusChangedEvent
    UIA->>UES: OnFocusChanged(element)
    UES->>UES: Check if element changed
    UES->>Reader: Invoke OnFocusChanged()
    Reader->>Reader: AnnounceCurrentElement()
    Reader->>UEL: GetName(element)
    UEL-->>Reader: "B5"
    Reader->>UEL: GetControlType(element)
    UEL-->>Reader: "Edit"
    Reader->>UEL: GetValue(element)
    UEL-->>Reader: "1000"
    Reader->>Reader: Build announcement: "B5 Edit 1000"
    Reader->>TTS: Speak("B5 Edit 1000")
    TTS->>User: Audio: "B5 Edit 1000"
